---
description: When finishing a task or updating documentation
alwaysApply: false
---

[FINISH][!CLOSE] When finishing work on a feature, fix, or file change:

[REVIEW][!CODE-QUALITY] Examine new code; ensure it follows good Ruby/Rails coding practices.

[LINT][!CLEAN] Run rubocop with auto-fix; ensure everything is clean.

[TEST][!FAST] Run fast tests during development: ruby lib/test_runner.rb --speed fast

[TEST][!ALL] Run all tests before finishing: ruby lib/test_runner.rb --speed all

[TEST][!PASS] Ensure all tests pass after cleanup and linting.

[TEST][!SPEED-PROFILE] Verify all new tests have appropriate speed_profile declarations (:fast, :medium, or :slow).

[DOCS][!UPDATE] Update relevant documentation to reflect changes.

[CLEAN][!TEMP] Remove any temporary files or debugging code.
